{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you wish to pass the time in cheerful enjoyment, please turn back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you would like to feel depressed, please do play this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aOverview\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genres: Psychological Thriller, Horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duration: Approximately 10 minutes per playthrough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aStory\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be shown a self-proclaimed victim, and the person whom they claim is the wrongdoer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will listen to their conversation, and from a neutral standpoint, you will determine whether the victim should take their revenge against the wrongdoer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But do exercise caution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all, revenge here means that &quot;the wrongdoer will be sentenced to death at the victim's hands&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aGame Mechanics\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short horror visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will listen to the characters' conversations, or characters will directly address the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please choose the option that aligns with your opinion, and proceed accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 rooms (stages) + 1 bonus room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aContent Advisory\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- This game contains no grotesque imagery. Those who are uncomfortable with such images can rest assured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgro