 characters' conversations, or characters will directly address the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please choose the option that aligns with your opinion, and proceed accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 rooms (stages) + 1 bonus room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aContent Advisory\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- This game contains no grotesque imagery. Those who are uncomfortable with such images can rest assured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["IEOI"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577000/b43d30b29ea3e69235c7b7266adcd5b76ccd588b/header.jpg?t=1763903756","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3577000/357349879/7d564f2ea29399d4c5ee9a3c9eccfff345237436/1750470445/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753113937","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3577000/357349879/7d564f2ea29399d4c5ee9a3c9eccfff345237436/1750470445/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753113937","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3577000/357349879/7d564f2ea29399d4c5ee9a3c9eccfff345237436/1750470445/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753113937","id":257117445,"name":"\u65ad\u7f6a\u5ba4\u30c7\u30a3\u30b6\u30fc\u30e0\u30fc\u30d3\u30fc","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117445/643ad31ecfa128444af5967195f8f6a1391e356c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753113937"}],"name":"\u65ad\u7f6a\u5ba4","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"\u65ad